": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-08d3cd5986", "malformed": true}, {"t_ms": 377282, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01AtdgPjjUHraYGUzn1FdeUb", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 381434, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** In `src/money.py`, `round_money` rounded with `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring says banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). That made `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` fail: 2.665 rounded to 2.67 when the test expects 2.66.\n- **Fix:** On the new branch `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`, I changed `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit 08d3cd5986).\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI didn't merge it, because merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LDbrJ4Fe2HjMJRtJJ4tUnv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013ZzyHmtKohKPKio75bx1eu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01YXAjSnhcgE4UN7KtxdDmr6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NmZyewjNQtQGqk4MX6wEvH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", 