ounded with `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its docstring says banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). That made `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` fail: 2.665 rounded to 2.67 when the test expects 2.66.\n- **Fix:** On the new branch `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`, I changed `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit 08d3cd5986).\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI didn't merge it, because merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}